  "about": "Visit dates kept on the device (src/lib/visit-dates.ts): the Cairo date each place was marked visited. Each case starts from empty storage, with the store listening for other tabs' changes, and runs its steps in order; each step is the operation (`do`), then `held`, the dates the app holds after it, and `stored`, the stored text. `record` marks a place visited at an instant (UTC), stored as that instant's Cairo date; `forget` removes dates; `visited` says which places are visited now (once set, an unsaved date is replayed only for a place still visited, and an unsaved forget only for one no longer visited); `failWrites` and `external` are as in id-set-store.json.",
